    "detailed_description": "Ready to feel the pressure of a fresh produce warehouse ? <br>Can you keep up with the demand ?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Managing the Flow</h2>Order products from the supplier.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Receive and transport the pallets to the loading dock.<br>Dispatch the pallets on different pending orders.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handling the Pressure</h2>But watch out, things heat up fast ! Orders flood in, deadlines shorten, and unexpected events occur.<br>You'll need to stay cool-headed to make it through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Out for the Unexpected</h2>From power outages to server crashes, you never know what's coming.<br>Stay sharp and think on your feet to keep the operation running smoothly!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonuses and Upgrades</h2>Get bonuses to help you gain some breathing room when things get intense, like express delivery or slow motion.<br>Improve your setup with upgrades that'll streamline your operation, like pallet size or increased order prep time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2>Arcade: Test your mettle with random bonuses and upgrades, aiming to rack up points before hitting the limit of missed orders.<br>Career: Manage your resources wisely, buying bonuses and upgrades at the end of each day to stay afloat as long as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Earn all the stars for each warehouse and game mode.<br>Leaderboard: See how you stack up against other players.",
    "about_the_game": "Ready to feel the pressure of a fresh produce warehouse ? <br>Can you keep up with the demand ?<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Managing the Flow</h2>Order products from the supplier.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/00f4dbc9b44761503b7b87fba0c35787.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Receive and transport the pallets to the loading dock.<br>Dispatch the pallets on different pending orders.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/cd96fe59476887e172b5528f7f0eedb6.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Handling the Pressure</h2>But watch out, things heat up fast ! Orders flood in, deadlines shorten, and unexpected events occur.<br>You'll need to stay cool-headed to make it through.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/5bbe5abcf8c7ea58220e5aa825f7ebb1.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Watch Out for the Unexpected</h2>From power outages to server crashes, you never know what's coming.<br>Stay sharp and think on your feet to keep the operation running smoothly!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.poster.avif?t=1739869879\" width=800 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.webm?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2667840/extras/6cbfb82cf13490ee4461c55b04077d0d.mp4?t=1739869879\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Bonuses and Upgrades</h2>Get bonuses to help you gain some breathing room when things get intense, like express delivery or slow motion.<br>Improve your setup with upgrades that'll streamline your operation, like pallet size or increased order prep time.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Modes</h2>Arcade: Test your mettle with random bonuses and upgrades, aiming to rack up points before hitting the limit of missed orders.<br>Career: Manage your resources wisely, buying bonuses and upgrades at the end of each day to stay afloat as long as possible.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Achievements</h2>Earn all the stars for each warehouse and game mode.<br>Leaderboard: See how you stack up against other players.",
